XCharter-Roman.otf and XCharter-Italic.otf are XCharter 1.24 by Michael Sharpe,
an extension of Bitstream Charter, copied from TeX Live 2023
(texmf-dist/fonts/opentype/public/xcharter). They are licensed as free fonts
under the same terms as the original from Bitstream, whose licence follows,
as that licence requires.

